{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    The sequence is defined by P(1) = 1, P(2) = 1, and P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)) for n > 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 2:\n        return 1\n\n    # Memoization dictionary to store computed values\n    # Initialize with base cases\n    memo = {1: 1, 2: 1}\n\n    # Recursive helper function with explicit memoization\n    def _calculate(k):\n        if k in memo:\n            return memo[k]\n        \n        # Calculate P(k) using the recurrence relation\n        val = _calculate(_calculate(k - 1)) + _calculate(k - _calculate(k - 1))\n        memo[k] = val\n        return val\n\n    return _calculate(n)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    P(1) = 1, P(2) = 1, P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)) for n > 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    memo = {}\n\n    def calculate_p(k):\n        \"\"\"Helper to compute P(k) with memoization.\"\"\"\n        if k in memo:\n            return memo[k]\n\n        if k == 1 or k == 2:\n            result = 1\n        else: # k > 2\n            # P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1))\n            p_n_minus_1 = calculate_p(k - 1)\n            \n            # The arguments P(n-1) and n - P(n-1) are guaranteed to be >= 1\n            # for k > 2 in the Newman-Conway sequence.\n            p_p_n_minus_1 = calculate_p(p_n_minus_1)\n            p_k_minus_p_n_minus_1 = calculate_p(k - p_n_minus_1)\n            \n            result = p_p_n_minus_1 + p_k_minus_p_n_minus_1\n        \n        memo[k] = result\n        return result\n\n    return calculate_p(n)"}
