{"task_id": "Mbpp/93", "solution": "def power(a, b):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the value of 'a' raised to the power 'b'.\n    This function handles integer exponents.\n    \"\"\"\n    if b == 0:\n        return 1\n    elif b < 0:\n        a_power_abs_b = 1\n        for _ in range(abs(b)):\n            a_power_abs_b *= a\n        return 1 / a_power_abs_b\n    else: # b > 0\n        result = 1\n        for _ in range(b):\n            result *= a\n        return result"}
