{"task_id": "Mbpp/131", "solution": "def reverse_vowels(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Reverses only the vowels in a given string, preserving consonant positions and character case.\n    'y' is not considered a vowel.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _is_vowel(char: str) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Determines if a character is a vowel (a,e,i,o,u, case-insensitive).\"\"\"\n        return char.lower() in 'aeiou'\n\n    def _extract_vowels(s: str) -> list:\n        \"\"\"Extracts vowels from string maintaining their original case.\"\"\"\n        extracted = []\n        for char in s:\n            if _is_vowel(char):\n                extracted.append(char)\n        return extracted\n\n    def _reconstruct_string(original: str, reversed_vowels: list) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Rebuilds string with reversed vowels in original positions.\"\"\"\n        result_chars = list(original)\n        vowel_index_in_reversed = 0\n        for i in range(len(result_chars)):\n            if _is_vowel(result_chars[i]):\n                result_chars[i] = reversed_vowels[vowel_index_in_reversed]\n                vowel_index_in_reversed += 1\n        return \"\".join(result_chars)\n\n    vowels = _extract_vowels(input_string)\n    vowels.reverse()\n    return _reconstruct_string(input_string, vowels)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/131", "solution": "def reverse_vowels(s: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Reverses only the vowels of a given string (where y is not a vowel).\"\"\"\n\n    def _is_vowel(char: str) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a character is a vowel (a,e,i,o,u case-insensitive, 'y' is not a vowel).\"\"\"\n        return char.lower() in 'aeiou'\n\n    def _extract_vowels(input_string: str) -> list:\n        \"\"\"Extracts all vowels from string in order with position info as a list of (vowel_char, position) tuples.\"\"\"\n        vowels_and_positions = []\n        for i, char in enumerate(input_string):\n            if _is_vowel(char):\n                vowels_and_positions.append((char, i))\n        return vowels_and_positions\n\n    def _reverse_vowels_list(vowels_chars: list) -> list:\n        \"\"\"Reverses the order of vowel characters in the provided list.\"\"\"\n        return vowels_chars[::-1]\n\n    def _reconstruct_string(input_string: str, reversed_vowels: list, vowel_positions: list) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Builds the final string with reversed vowels at their original positions.\"\"\"\n        s_list = list(input_string)\n        for i, pos in enumerate(vowel_positions):\n            s_list[pos] = reversed_vowels[i]\n        return \"\".join(s_list)\n\n    if not s:\n        return s\n\n    extracted_vowels_with_pos = _extract_vowels(s)\n\n    if not extracted_vowels_with_pos:\n        return s # No vowels found, return original string\n\n    vowel_chars_original_order = [item[0] for item in extracted_vowels_with_pos]\n    vowel_positions = [item[1] for item in extracted_vowels_with_pos]\n\n    reversed_vowel_chars = _reverse_vowels_list(vowel_chars_original_order)\n\n    return _reconstruct_string(s, reversed_vowel_chars, vowel_positions)"}
