{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(array: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the ratio of zeroes to non-zeroes in an array of integers.\n    Uses a single pass for efficient counting and handles edge cases for the ratio calculation.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _calculate_ratio(zero_c: int, non_zero_c: int) -> float:\n        \"\"\"\n        Calculates the ratio of zero count to non-zero count, handling division by zero scenarios.\n        \"\"\"\n        if non_zero_c == 0:\n            if zero_c == 0:\n                # For an empty array (0/0), the ratio is undefined (NaN).\n                return float('nan')\n            else:\n                # If there are zeroes but no non-zeroes (e.g., [0,0,0]), the ratio is infinite.\n                return float('inf')\n        else:\n            # Standard ratio calculation.\n            return float(zero_c) / non_zero_c\n\n    zero_count_val = 0\n    non_zero_count_val = 0\n\n    # Perform a single pass through the array to count both zeroes and non-zeroes efficiently.\n    for num in array:\n        if num == 0:\n            zero_count_val += 1\n        else:\n            non_zero_count_val += 1\n    \n    # Delegate the final ratio calculation, which includes edge case handling.\n    return _calculate_ratio(zero_count_val, non_zero_count_val)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef _count_zeros(array: List[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Count elements with value exactly 0.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for x in array:\n        if x == 0:\n            count += 1\n    return count\n\ndef _count_non_zeros(array: List[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Count elements with value not equal to 0.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for x in array:\n        if x != 0:\n            count += 1\n    return count\n\ndef zero_count(array: List[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculate ratio of zeros to non-zeros in integer array.\"\"\"\n    zeros = _count_zeros(array)\n    non_zeros = _count_non_zeros(array)\n\n    if non_zeros == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    \n    return float(zeros) / non_zeros"}
