{"task_id": "Mbpp/256", "solution": "def count_Primes_nums(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of prime numbers less than the given non-negative number.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _is_prime(n: int) -> bool:\n        if n < 2:\n            return False\n        # Check for divisibility up to the square root of n.\n        i = 2\n        while i * i <= n:\n            if n % i == 0:\n                return False\n            i += 1\n        return True\n\n    if number < 2:\n        return 0\n\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(2, number):\n        if _is_prime(i):\n            count += 1\n    return count"}
