{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    It sums the cubes from 1 to n and then divides by n.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _calculate_cube(number):\n        \"\"\"Calculates the cube of a single integer number.\"\"\"\n        return number ** 3\n\n    sum_of_cubes = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        sum_of_cubes += _calculate_cube(i)\n    \n    average = sum_of_cubes / n\n    return average"}
