{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def _calculate_factors(number: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Calculates all factors of the input number.\"\"\"\n    factors = set()\n    for i in range(1, int(number**0.5) + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            factors.add(i)\n            factors.add(number // i)\n    return sorted(list(factors))\n\ndef _filter_even_factors(factors: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Filters a list of factors to include only even numbers.\"\"\"\n    return [factor for factor in factors if factor % 2 == 0]\n\ndef _sum_factors(factors: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of a list of factors.\"\"\"\n    return sum(factors)\n\ndef sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sum of even factors of a number.\n    Orchestrates factor calculation, filtering, and summation.\n    \"\"\"\n    all_factors = _calculate_factors(number)\n    even_factors = _filter_even_factors(all_factors)\n    return _sum_factors(even_factors)"}
