{"task_id": "Mbpp/454", "solution": "def text_match_wordz(input_string: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if any word in the input string contains the character 'z'.\n    Returns True if a word with 'z' is found, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    import re\n    from typing import List\n\n    def _extract_words(text: str) -> List[str]:\n        \"\"\"\n        Extracts words from text, removing punctuation.\n        Returns a list of cleaned words.\n        \"\"\"\n        return re.findall(r'\\b\\w+\\b', text)\n\n    def _contains_z(word: str) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"\n        Checks if a word contains the character 'z'.\n        Returns True if found, False otherwise.\n        \"\"\"\n        return 'z' in word\n\n    words = _extract_words(input_string)\n    return any(_contains_z(word) for word in words)"}
