{"task_id": "Mbpp/556", "solution": "def is_odd(value):\n    \"\"\"Determines if a number is odd.\"\"\"\n    return value % 2 != 0\n\ndef calculate_xor(a, b):\n    \"\"\"Performs XOR operation between two integers.\"\"\"\n    return a ^ b\n\ndef generate_pairs(array):\n    \"\"\"Generates all unique pairs from array elements.\"\"\"\n    pairs = []\n    n = len(array)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            pairs.append((array[i], array[j]))\n    return pairs\n\ndef count_odd_xor_pairs(array, size):\n    \"\"\"Counts pairs with odd XOR values.\"\"\"\n    odd_xor_count = 0\n    pairs = generate_pairs(array)\n    for element1, element2 in pairs:\n        xor_result = calculate_xor(element1, element2)\n        if is_odd(xor_result):\n            odd_xor_count += 1\n    return odd_xor_count\n\ndef find_Odd_Pair(array, size):\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of pairs whose XOR value is odd.\"\"\"\n    return count_odd_xor_pairs(array, size)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/556", "solution": "def find_Odd_Pair(array: list, size: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Count pairs with odd XOR values by counting odd and even numbers.\"\"\"\n    odd_count = 0\n    even_count = 0\n\n    for i in range(size):\n        if array[i] % 2 == 0:\n            even_count += 1\n        else:\n            odd_count += 1\n            \n    return odd_count * even_count"}
