{"task_id": "Mbpp/594", "solution": "def diff_even_odd(numbers: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the difference of the first even and first odd number in a given list.\n    Raises ValueError if either an even or an odd number is not found.\n    \"\"\"\n    def find_first_even(numbers: list) -> int | None:\n        \"\"\"Helper to find the first even number in the list.\"\"\"\n        for num in numbers:\n            if num % 2 == 0:\n                return num\n        return None\n\n    def find_first_odd(numbers: list) -> int | None:\n        \"\"\"Helper to find the first odd number in the list.\"\"\"\n        for num in numbers:\n            if num % 2 != 0:\n                return num\n        return None\n\n    def calculate_difference(even: int, odd: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Helper to calculate the difference between two numbers (even - odd).\"\"\"\n        return even - odd\n\n    first_even = find_first_even(numbers)\n    first_odd = find_first_odd(numbers)\n\n    if first_even is None:\n        raise ValueError(\"No even number found\")\n    if first_odd is None:\n        raise ValueError(\"No odd number found\")\n\n    return calculate_difference(first_even, first_odd)"}
