{"task_id": "Mbpp/733", "solution": "def find_first_occurrence(array: list, target: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the index of the first occurrence of a target number in a sorted array using binary search.\n    Returns -1 if the target is not found.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(array) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if array[mid] == target:\n            result = mid\n            high = mid - 1  # Try to find an earlier occurrence in the left half\n        elif array[mid] < target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid - 1\n    return result"}
