{"task_id": "Mbpp/733", "solution": "def find_first_occurrence(array: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the index of the first occurrence of a given number in a sorted array.\n    Uses binary search to achieve O(log n) time complexity.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(array) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if array[mid] == target:\n            result = mid  # Found a potential first occurrence\n            high = mid - 1  # Continue searching in the left half for an earlier occurrence\n        elif array[mid] < target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:  # array[mid] > target\n            high = mid - 1\n            \n    return result"}
