{"task_id": "Mbpp/745", "solution": "def extract_digits(number: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Extracts individual digits from an integer and returns them as a list.\"\"\"\n    return [int(digit) for digit in str(number)]\n\ndef contains_zero(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a number contains the digit 0.\"\"\"\n    return '0' in str(number)\n\ndef is_divisible_by_all_digits(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a number is divisible by all its constituent digits.\"\"\"\n    digits = extract_digits(number)\n    for digit in digits:\n        if number % digit != 0:\n            return False\n    return True\n\ndef divisible_by_digits(startnum: int, endnum: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds numbers within a given range (inclusive) where every number is divisible by every digit it contains.\n    Numbers containing the digit 0 are excluded to prevent division by zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    for number in range(startnum, endnum + 1):\n        if not contains_zero(number):\n            if is_divisible_by_all_digits(number):\n                result.append(number)\n    return result"}
