{"task_id": "Mbpp/745", "solution": "def divisible_by_digits(startnum: int, endnum: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Finds numbers within a range where each number is divisible by every digit it contains.\"\"\"\n\n    def extract_digits(number: int) -> list[int]:\n        \"\"\"Extracts individual digits from a number.\"\"\"\n        return [int(d) for d in str(number)]\n\n    def contains_zero(number: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a number contains the digit 0.\"\"\"\n        return '0' in str(number)\n\n    def is_divisible_by_all_digits(number: int, digits: list[int]) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a number is divisible by all its digits.\"\"\"\n        for digit in digits:\n            if number % digit != 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    result = []\n    for number in range(startnum, endnum + 1):\n        if not contains_zero(number):\n            digits = extract_digits(number)\n            if is_divisible_by_all_digits(number, digits):\n                result.append(number)\n    return result"}
