{"task_id": "Mbpp/748", "solution": "def capital_words_spaces(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Insert spaces before capital letters that follow lowercase letters or digits.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_string:\n        return \"\"\n\n    def _is_capital_after_lower_or_digit(prev_char: str, curr_char: str) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Determines if the current character is an uppercase letter following a lowercase letter or digit.\"\"\"\n        return curr_char.isupper() and (prev_char.islower() or prev_char.isdigit())\n\n    def _should_insert_space(prev_char: str, curr_char: str) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Helper to determine if a space should be inserted between characters.\"\"\"\n        return _is_capital_after_lower_or_digit(prev_char, curr_char)\n\n    result_chars = [input_string[0]]\n\n    for i in range(1, len(input_string)):\n        prev_char = input_string[i-1]\n        curr_char = input_string[i]\n\n        if _should_insert_space(prev_char, curr_char):\n            result_chars.append(' ')\n        result_chars.append(curr_char)\n\n    return \"\".join(result_chars)"}
