{"task_id": "Mbpp/769", "solution": "def Diff(first_list, second_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the difference between two lists, returning elements from the first list\n    that are not in the second, then reorders them with evens before odds.\n    \"\"\"\n    second_set = set(second_list)\n    filtered_elements = []\n    for item in first_list:\n        if item not in second_set:\n            filtered_elements.append(item)\n\n    even_numbers = []\n    odd_numbers = []\n    for item in filtered_elements:\n        if item % 2 == 0:\n            even_numbers.append(item)\n        else:\n            odd_numbers.append(item)\n\n    return even_numbers + odd_numbers"}
