{"task_id": "Mbpp/808", "solution": "def check_K(tuple_data, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given value k is present in the tuple_data.\n    Returns True if k is found, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    return k in tuple_data"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(tuple1, tuple2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if each element of the second tuple is smaller than its corresponding element in the first tuple.\n    Assumes tuples have equal length and contain comparable numeric elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    for i in range(len(tuple1)):\n        if not (tuple2[i] < tuple1[i]):\n            return False\n    return True"}
